{"seq":3,"slug":"task-state-machine-idempotent-dispatch","title":"任务状态机、指令下发确认与幂等重试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/wcs-architecture-equipment-model/task-state-machine-idempotent-dispatch","wordCount":2805,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务状态机-指令下发确认与幂等重试\">任务状态机、指令下发确认与幂等重试</h1><p>大促峰值下一台交叉带分拣机每秒要吃掉 2–3 个包裹，每个包裹对应一条「送去 42 号格口」的指令。这些指令穿过 WiFi、工业以太网、消息代理和 PLC 扫描周期：任一环抖动，同一条指令就可能到达两次、零次，或到达了但回执丢了。要做出「恰好一次」的业务效果，靠的是<strong>显式状态机 + 分层确认 + 幂等去重</strong>的组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条任务在 WCS 里同时存在三份「状态」，其描述对象、更新频率、权威性都不同。把它们混进一张表，是这类系统最常见的架构病。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态层</th>\n<th>拥有者</th>\n<th>描述对象</th>\n<th>更新触发</th>\n<th>权威性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务状态</td>\n<td>WMS</td>\n<td>订单行 / 发货单</td>\n<td>库存动作、拣选确认</td>\n<td>财务与客户承诺的真相</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务状态</td>\n<td>WES / WCS</td>\n<td>一次搬运/分拣任务的生命周期</td>\n<td>指令下发、设备回执、超时</td>\n<td>调度决策的真相</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理状态</td>\n<td>PLC / 设备控制器</td>\n<td>电机、气缸、光电的实际位姿</td>\n<td>毫秒级扫描周期</td>\n<td>物理事实的唯一真相</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键约束是：<strong>物理状态永远是对的，任务状态只是对它的一个有延迟的观测</strong>，WCS 持有的只是「待确认的意图」，直到设备侧回执到达才落为事实。交付语义是第二个前置概念：MQTT 定义三级服务质量——QoS 0「至多一次」（可能丢）、QoS 1「至少一次」（到达但可能重复）、QoS 2「恰好一次」（只到达一次）（来源：MQTT 官方站，<a href=\"https://mqtt.org/\">https://mqtt.org/</a> ）；VDA 5050 对 <code>order</code>、<code>state</code> 等业务消息明确选用 <strong>QoS 0</strong>，只在 <code>connection</code> 上用 QoS 1（来源：VDA5050 v3.0.0，<a href=\"https://github.com/VDA5050/VDA5050\">https://github.com/VDA5050/VDA5050</a> ）——无线链路下追求传输层「恰好一次」代价高、收益低，不如把重复交给上层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[WES/WCS 生成任务] --&gt; B[CREATED 已创建]&#10;    B --&gt; C[DISPATCHED 已下发]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ACKED 已接受]&#10;    D --&gt; E[EXECUTING 执行中]&#10;    E --&gt; F[COMPLETED 已完成]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|超时未确认| C&#10;    D -.-&gt;|取消请求| G[CANCELLED 已取消]&#10;    E -.-&gt;|设备故障| H[FAILED 已失败]\">flowchart TD\n    A[WES/WCS 生成任务] --&gt; B[CREATED 已创建]\n    B --&gt; C[DISPATCHED 已下发]\n    C --&gt; D[ACKED 已接受]\n    D --&gt; E[EXECUTING 执行中]\n    E --&gt; F[COMPLETED 已完成]\n    C -.-&gt;|超时未确认| C\n    D -.-&gt;|取消请求| G[CANCELLED 已取消]\n    E -.-&gt;|设备故障| H[FAILED 已失败]</pre><p>确认与幂等是同一枚硬币的两面：确认解决「发送方知不知道对方收到了」，幂等解决「对方收到多次会怎样」；少了任何一个，重试都会出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"任务状态机-合法迁移与守卫条件\">任务状态机：合法迁移与守卫条件</h2><p>WCS 的任务状态机是<strong>运行时的执法者</strong>：每次状态写入都必须通过守卫（guard）检查，非法迁移直接拒绝并记异常。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>允许的下一步</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>CREATED</code></td>\n<td>已生成，未下发</td>\n<td><code>DISPATCHED</code>、<code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DISPATCHED</code></td>\n<td>已发往设备，等回执</td>\n<td><code>ACKED</code>、<code>DISPATCHED</code>(重发)、<code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ACKED</code></td>\n<td>设备已接受，未执行完</td>\n<td><code>EXECUTING</code>、<code>FAILED</code>、<code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EXECUTING</code></td>\n<td>设备正在动作</td>\n<td><code>COMPLETED</code>、<code>FAILED</code>、<code>HELD</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HELD</code></td>\n<td>人工/上游挂起</td>\n<td><code>EXECUTING</code>、<code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COMPLETED</code> / <code>FAILED</code> / <code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n<td>终态：完成且已确认 / 执行失败 / 已取消</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前五个为非终态，需按类型设超时动作（等待调度、重发或转人工、告警、看门狗巡检、升级告警）。标准里能直接借用这套词汇：VDA 5050 v3.0.0 的机器人动作状态枚举是 <code>INITIALIZING</code>、<code>RUNNING</code>、<code>PAUSED</code>、<code>FINISHED</code>、<code>FAILED</code>、<code>RETRIABLE</code>，被 <code>actionStates</code>、<code>instantActionStates</code>、<code>zoneActionStates</code> 共用；其中 <code>RETRIABLE</code> 把「失败但可重试」与「失败且不可重试」分开，由 <code>retry</code> 或 <code>skipRetry</code> 决定后续，而多数自研状态机把失败记成单一终态，重试逻辑只能写在状态机外。</p>\n<p>守卫检查三件事——当前状态是否允许该迁移（结构合法）、发起者是否有权（来源校验）、业务前置是否满足（如目标格口未被占用）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"transition(task, event):&#10;  require task.state in ALLOWED[event]        # 结构守卫&#10;  require event.seq &gt; task.last_seq           # 单调序号守卫（丢弃陈旧/重复）&#10;  require resource_available(task.target)     # 业务守卫&#10;  persist(task.state = event.to, last_seq = event.seq)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>transition(task, event):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  require task.state in ALLOWED[event]        # 结构守卫</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  require event.seq > task.last_seq           # 单调序号守卫（丢弃陈旧/重复）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  require resource_available(task.target)     # 业务守卫</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  persist(task.state = event.to, last_seq = event.seq)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二行的<strong>单调序号守卫</strong>是幂等体系的基座：为每条任务维护已处理的最大序号，任何序号不大于它的消息一律丢弃，一次挡住重复投递与陈旧乱序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指令下发与确认握手\">指令下发与确认握手</h2><p>下发确认的核心问题是：<strong>发送方在多久内没收到回执才应该重发？</strong> 这个窗口直接决定重复率与故障恢复延迟，二者不可兼得。握手分三段：下发（Dispatch）→ 接受（Ack）→ 完成（Complete）。中间的「已接受」段最容易被省掉，也最致命——没有它，WCS 分不清「指令丢了」和「指令在执行中只是回执丢了」，只能盲目重发。</p>\n<p>三种路线差别很大。<strong>显式 ACK</strong> 由设备或网关单独回一条携带指令标识与序号的确认消息，语义最清晰，代价是多一跳开销。<strong>隐式 ACK</strong> 是 VDA 5050 的路线：没有独立的「订单确认」消息，接受与否体现在 <code>state</code> 是否带上对应的 <code>orderUpdateId</code>；若迟迟收不到该 <code>state</code>，车队控制侧可重发订单，而内容完全相同的重复更新会被忽略。<code>state</code> 在订单、载荷、错误、动作/节点/边状态等事件发生时发布，最迟每 30 秒必发一次，也可用 <code>stateRequest</code> 强制触发（来源：VDA 5050 v3.0.0）。<strong>位握手</strong>用在 PLC 层，典型是「执行位 + 完成位 + 故障位」三件套，执行位取<strong>边沿触发而非电平触发</strong>——只有控制字里的指令序号变化时 PLC 才启动新动作。</p>\n<p>OPC UA（标准化为 IEC 62541）提供了更结构化的通道：客户端-服务器模型支持方法调用、订阅与事件（一对一通知有送达保证）以及带认证与审计的会话；发布/订阅在 Part 14 定义、可承载于 UDP/AMQP/MQTT，但规范未对 PubSub 给出同等强度的送达保证（来源：OPC Foundation，<a href=\"https://opcfoundation.org/about/opc-technologies/opc-ua/\">https://opcfoundation.org/about/opc-technologies/opc-ua/</a> ）。<strong>所以需强确认的下发走请求/响应或方法调用，纯状态广播才走 PubSub。</strong> 超时窗口取 P99 响应时间加安全裕度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{timeout} = \\mu_{resp} + z \\cdot \\sigma_{resp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\approx 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>）：输送线 WCS 的接受回执常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{resp} = 30\\text{–}80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> ms、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{resp} = 20\\text{–}40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> ms，取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 得约 150–200 ms；窗口过小则抖动即触发大量重复，过大则停机察觉太慢，应分设备类型标定，并用指数退避加抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>j</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_n = \\min\\left(T_{max},\\ T_0 \\cdot 2^{n}\\right) \\cdot \\left(1 + U(-1, 1) \\cdot j\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j \\approx 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>）避免重试风暴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等重试-标识-去重与对账\">幂等重试：标识、去重与对账</h2><p>在「至少一次」交付下做到等效「恰好一次」，有两段式答案：<strong>发送侧用事务性发件箱（Transactional Outbox），接收侧用幂等消费者（Idempotent Consumer）</strong>。</p>\n<p>发送侧的问题是双写：WCS 既要在本地库更新任务状态，又要发消息，而数据库提交与消息发布无法用 2PC 可靠协调。事务性发件箱在<strong>同一个本地事务</strong>里同时更新业务数据与写入一条 <code>OUTBOX</code> 记录，保证「消息当且仅当数据库事务提交时才被发送」，再由独立中继取出已提交记录发布；中继若在发布后、标记前崩溃会重复发布，因此它给出的是<strong>至少一次</strong>投递，消费侧必须容忍重复（来源：microservices.io, <em>Transactional Outbox</em>，<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html\">https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html</a> ）。接收侧用去重表：把 <code>(consumerId, messageId)</code> 作主键插入，重复插入因主键冲突失败并回滚忽略（来源：microservices.io, <em>Idempotent Consumer</em>，<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/communication-style/idempotent-consumer.html\">https://microservices.io/patterns/communication-style/idempotent-consumer.html</a> ）。落到 WCS，三类标识各司其职：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标识</th>\n<th>生成者</th>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>去重语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>taskId</code></td>\n<td>WES/WCS</td>\n<td>全局，跨重试不变</td>\n<td>同一任务的整个生命周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>commandSeq</code></td>\n<td>WCS</td>\n<td>单设备通道内单调递增</td>\n<td>挡住重复与乱序（取最大者）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>orderUpdateId</code></td>\n<td>上级</td>\n<td>一次任务的多次更新</td>\n<td>同 ID 同内容忽略，同 ID 异内容报错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VDA 5050 对第三类定义得很干净：新订单 <code>orderUpdateId</code> 为 0，更新保持 <code>orderId</code> 不变并递增；<strong>已释放的 base 段永不可改、不可重发</strong>，只有 horizon 段可改；<code>orderUpdateId</code> 不大于当前值的更新视为过期，同 ID 异内容报 <code>SAME_ORDER_UPDATE_ID</code>（来源：VDA 5050 v3.0.0）。还有一处易被忽略：<strong>自然幂等与键控幂等的区别</strong>。「设置目标格口」这类写值操作天然幂等，而「取一件货」「累加计数」没有自然幂等性，只能靠键控去重。其规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{dedup} = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 条/秒、窗口取 10 分钟时约 30 万行，内存即可承载；若窗口短于最长重试链跨度，一条迟到重试就会被当成新指令执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"悬挂任务-补偿与合规边界\">悬挂任务、补偿与合规边界</h2><p>即使三件套都做对，系统仍会残留<strong>永久停在非终态、既没完成也没失败</strong>的任务：设备侧执行完但回执丢了，或 WCS 重启时状态写盘而设备侧已推进。它们不会自愈，需主动巡检，三层兜底按代价递增：<strong>看门狗巡检</strong>（为每个非终态任务记录 <code>last_update_at</code>，超过与该设备类型匹配的阈值即判定悬挂）；<strong>状态对账</strong>（以设备侧物理事实回补任务状态，比「重新下发一遍」安全得多，因为重派一个实际已完成的取货任务可能造成重复出库）；<strong>取消与补偿</strong>（VDA 5050 的 <code>cancelOrder</code> 让机器人尽快停下，且取消后 <code>orderId</code> 与 <code>orderUpdateId</code> 被保留，来源：VDA 5050 v3.0.0——保留标识才能把迟到消息识别为非法更新）。</p>\n<p>这条链路跨越 IT 与 OT，重试出错时后果可能不只是效率问题。欧盟《机械法规》(EU) 2023/1230 于 2023-06-14 通过、过渡期至 2027-01-20 适用，取代原机械指令 2006/42/EC，明确把<strong>软件</strong>纳入机械定义与安全部件范畴（来源：EUR-Lex，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1230/oj\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1230/oj</a> ）。安全控制逻辑另有分层标准：ISO 13849-1（现行第 4 版，2023）为安全相关控制部件（SRP/CS）定义性能等级 PL a–e 与类别 B/1/2/3/4，所需等级 PLr 来自风险评估（来源：Wikipedia, <em>ISO 13849</em>，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_13849\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_13849</a> ）；PLC 程序的实现语言由 IEC 61131-3 规定（现行第 4 版 2025 年 5 月发布），其中 <strong>SFC（顺序功能图）</strong> 天然适合表达与 WCS 任务状态机同构的步进逻辑（来源：Wikipedia, <em>IEC 61131-3</em>，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEC_61131-3\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEC_61131-3</a> ）。合理分工是：安全联锁与急停下沉到 PLC 侧并满足 PLr，WCS 只管作业层任务的编排与幂等——<strong>WCS 的重试绝不能触碰安全链</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>业务状态、任务状态、物理状态是三份真相；物理状态永远权威，任务状态只是它的延迟观测。</li>\n<li>任务状态机必须是运行时执法者：守卫检查结构合法、来源有权、业务前置，其中单调序号守卫（丢弃 <code>seq ≤ last_seq</code>）是幂等体系的地基。</li>\n<li>握手分下发、接受、完成三段；隐式 ACK（以 <code>state</code> 中的 <code>orderUpdateId</code> 为接受证据）省一跳，PLC 层用边沿触发位握手加指令序号做最底层保护。超时窗口按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = \\mu + 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 分设备标定（输送线常落在 150–200 ms）。</li>\n<li>等效「恰好一次」= 发送侧事务性发件箱 + 接收侧幂等消费者；<code>taskId</code> 管生命周期、<code>commandSeq</code> 管通道内去重排序、<code>orderUpdateId</code> 管多次更新。</li>\n<li>合规边界不能越：软件已是 (EU) 2023/1230 下的机械部件，安全联锁须按 ISO 13849-1 达到 PLr、用 IEC 61131-3（第 4 版，2025-05）实现在 PLC 侧。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文与本 hub 分层章节互为参照：任务状态机的边界划分见 <a href=\"wcs-control-hierarchy-wes-wms-boundary\">WCS/WES/WMS 分层职责与系统边界</a>，那里解释了为什么任务状态由 WES/WCS 而非 WMS 拥有。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务状态机、指令下发确认与幂等重试","id":"任务状态机-指令下发确认与幂等重试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务状态机：合法迁移与守卫条件","id":"任务状态机-合法迁移与守卫条件"},{"level":2,"text":"指令下发与确认握手","id":"指令下发与确认握手"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等重试：标识、去重与对账","id":"幂等重试-标识-去重与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"悬挂任务、补偿与合规边界","id":"悬挂任务-补偿与合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"设备模型、PLC 标签点位与状态遥测建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/wcs-architecture-equipment-model/equipment-model-plc-tag-point-address"},"next":{"title":"输送线拓扑、积放与流量控制（ZPA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/conveyor-sortation-routing/conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow"}}